      "body": "Hi. For the per-frame pose labels provided in the poses@60fps folder, I wonder what is the correspondence between actual hand joints and the row index for \"0\" and \"1\" in per-frame landmarks, as well as which of the \"0\" and \"1\" represents the right hand?\r\n\r\nThanks.\r\n\r\n",
