        "body": "Dear Frances,\r\n\r\nJoint connectivity of our model can be found [here](https://github.com/assembly-101/assembly101-action-recognition/blob/main/MS-G3D-action-recognition/MS_G3D/graph/assembly101_hands.py).\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/100765171/199047181-bf10899f-e2a3-4a56-83f9-aedc38bb22b0.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n0 corresponds to the left hand and 1 corresponds to the right hand ([here](https://github.com/assembly-101/assembly101-action-recognition/blob/main/MS-G3D-action-recognition/Preprocess/1_generate_pose_data.py)).\r\n\r\n",
